    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Tucked away within the private and exclusive Fountain Courtyard development at the prestigious K Club in Straffan, Co. Kildare, French Estates are pleased to introduce No. 604 to the market. This attractive residence is located within the historic courtyard of the original Straffan House, now home to the elegant K Club Hotel and enjoys a prime position along the covered walkway connecting the hotel to the K Spa. Surrounded by beautifully maintained gardens that provide year-round colour, this distinctive setting offers both charm and convenience, with easy access to the K Club’s extensive amenities. The quaint village of Straffan is only a stones throw away and with the N7 and M4 close by, you will be in Dublin City in about 40 minutes. This stunningly located home comes to market as a blank canvas for a discerning buyer, offering a tranquil lifestyle in a peaceful and beautiful country setting while close proximity to major transport routes, Dublin city and Airport make this the ideal location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Kitchenette/ Living Room: 7.0 m x 5.5 m\r\nThe open plan kitchen and living area offers a blank canvas to create a stylish space tailored to your own taste with versatility and endless potential.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom : 5.5 m x 4.1 m \r\nSpacious master bedroom overlooking the Fountain Courtyard with access to a large bathroom and built in wall to wall wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.7 m x 2.2 m\r\nPart tiled bathroom with recessed spot lights and a white Villeroy & Boch three piece suite including wc, whb, bath with a pump shower and tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nGardens\r\nOverlooking its own peaceful and landscaped garden courtyard centred on its eponymous fountain located on the stunning grounds of the world renowned K Club\r\n\r\nIncluded in Sale\t\t\t\t\r\nCurtains\r\n\r\nTenure: Freehold\r\n\r\nServices\r\n   ● Service charges for 2026 €3,789.32\r\n   ● Mains Water, Drainage & Electricity"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "● c. 844.21 sq. ft (78.43 m2)\r\n● Built 1991\r\n● Large Master Bedroom with en-suite\r\n● High level of security\r\n● Landscaped courtyard with water feature\r\n● Gas heating \r\n● Adjacent to The K Club Hotel & Spa\r\n● Outside lawns and gardens maintained by Management Company"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Coming from Dublin on the M4, take exit 7 for Maynooth. At the Maynooth business campus roundabout take the 2nd exit onto Straffan Road. Proceed past Barberstown Castle towards Straffan Village continuing past both churches for approx. 300 meters and take a right turn into The K Club. Continue along the avenue towards the hotel, The Fountain Courtyard is the 4th left turn along the avenue and is adjacent to the main hotel car park."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By prior appointment only."
      }
    ],
